02:50.560 --> 02:53.870
Bunuh!

03:51.150 --> 03:52.030
Bunuh!

04:36.920 --> 04:38.870
Yang Mulia!

04:38.950 --> 04:39.830
Yang Mulia!

04:40.390 --> 04:41.270
Yang Mulia!

04:41.750 --> 04:44.000
